sequenceDiagram
  participant L as Laptop
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant P as Phone
  L->>DB: claim + session, every 30 s
  DB-->>L: held, gen 5
  P->>DB: watch
  DB-->>P: owner: laptop + session
  Note over P: Read-only timer<br/>and Continue here
  P->>DB: claim, force
  DB-->>P: held, gen 6
  Note over P: Controls come alive.<br/>Elapsed stays put.
  L->>DB: next beat
  DB-->>L: owner: phone, gen 6
  Note over L: Steps down<br/>to read-only
